WEBVTT

00:16:28.525 --> 00:16:33.809
What we really want is to arrive
right here, so we can stop the epidemic.

00:16:34.325 --> 00:16:35.756
But you can't always do that.

00:16:36.192 --> 00:16:39.749
But there's an organization
that has been able to find a way

00:16:39.773 --> 00:16:41.976
to learn when the first cases occur,

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:44.349
and that is called GPHIN;

00:16:44.373 --> 00:16:46.896
it's the Global Public Health
Information Network.

00:16:47.246 --> 00:16:49.334
And that simulation that I showed you

00:16:49.358 --> 00:16:51.555
that you thought
was bird flu -- that was SARS.

00:16:51.963 --> 00:16:54.763
And SARS is the pandemic
that did not occur.

00:16:55.332 --> 00:16:56.731
And it didn't occur

00:16:56.755 --> 00:17:03.066
because GPHIN found
the pandemic-to-be of SARS